    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The [`personSegmentationWithDepth`](arconfiguration/framesemantics-swift.struct/personsegmentationwithdepth.md) frame semantic specifies that any person ARKit detects in the camera feed should occlude virtual content, depending on the person’s depth in the scene.",
      "ko": "[`personSegmentationWithDepth`](arconfiguration/framesemantics-swift.struct/personsegmentationwithdepth.md) 프레임 시맨틱은 카메라 피드에서 ARKit이 감지한 사람을 장면의 깊이에 따라 가상 콘텐츠를 가리도록 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c78329147e77295b36d82e2bb68a0375561b42fb061c26e3ac432ae25bd2434c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "When this option is enabled, ARKit sets the [`estimatedDepthData`](arframe/estimateddepthdata.md) and [`segmentationBuffer`](arframe/segmentationbuffer.md) properties to serve as a foundation for people occlusion.",
      "ko": "이 옵션이 활성화되면 ARKit은 [`estimatedDepthData`](arframe/estimateddepthdata.md) 및 [`segmentationBuffer`](arframe/segmentationbuffer.md) 속성을 설정하여 사람 가림 처리의 기반으로 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "883472974051cbc9a2e076a961e15cbbb3e223adee59ff57d3e1b84a5329e461",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "The standard renderers ([`ARView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/RealityKit/ARView), and [`ARSCNView`](arscnview.md)) use those properties to implement people occlusion for you.",
      "ko": "표준 렌더러([`ARView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/RealityKit/ARView), and [`ARSCNView`](arscnview.md))는 해당 속성을 사용해 사람 가림 처리를 구현합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "fbfb39283e9476780c4452b38737212594ad238b0345940c7acb72f4be55c708",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0003",
      "source": "See [`frameSemantics`](arconfiguration/framesemantics-swift.property.md) for more information.",
      "ko": "자세한 내용은 [`frameSemantics`](arconfiguration/framesemantics-swift.property.md)에서 확인합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f747840248eeb2768275704ad88d5040b6dac1e188b5e9f781f3c189fc8a3eb5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
